# 🤖 AI Job Assistant

An AI-powered career assistant built with **FastAPI, Streamlit, Google Gemini, RAG, ChromaDB, and persistent memory**.

The application helps users interact with an AI career assistant, upload Job Descriptions, ask questions about them using Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), and interact with the assistant through chat and voice.

---

## 🚀 Features

### 🔐 Authentication

* User registration
* User login
* JWT-based authentication
* Protected API endpoints

### 💬 AI Chat

* General-purpose AI career assistant
* Powered by Google Gemini
* Conversational question answering

### 📄 Job Description Analyzer

* Upload Job Description files
* Extract text from documents
* Split documents into chunks
* Generate embeddings
* Store vectors using ChromaDB
* Ask questions about the uploaded Job Description

### 🧠 AI Memory

* Maintains conversational context
* Stores useful user information
* Enables personalized responses

### 🎤 Voice Assistant

* Speech-to-Text
* AI response generation
* Text-to-Speech
* Voice assistant API

### 🌐 REST API

Backend APIs are developed using FastAPI with automatic Swagger documentation.

