## 📄 RAG Workflow

The Job Description Analyzer follows this pipeline:

```text
Job Description PDF
        ↓
Text Extraction
        ↓
Text Chunking
        ↓
Embeddings
        ↓
ChromaDB
        ↓
Similarity Search
        ↓
Relevant JD Context
        ↓
Google Gemini
        ↓
AI Answer
```

The system is designed to answer questions based on the uploaded Job Description instead of blindly generating unrelated information.

